  "label": "Stereotype condemning reproduction based on perceived inferiority",
  "description": "The phrase 'breed you should not' is a dehumanizing metaphor that implies the target is biologically or morally unfit to reproduce. This concept is rooted in real-world stereotypes that have historically been used to devalue certain groups of people, particularly in racist, sexist, or ableist contexts. It is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the full weight and intent of the meme.",
